t to tamper with app binaries or encryption keys.','No Authorization Bypass: You must not attempt to exploit APIs, bypass role-based access controls, or gain unauthorized access to Admin modules or other users\' data.','No Malicious Backup Injection: Injecting modified, malicious, or foreign user IDs into backup archives to corrupt data or compromise system integrity is strictly prohibited.']},{id:'financial-disclaimer',icon:o.AlertTriangle,title:'5. Financial Disclaimer',content:['Personal Bookkeeping Tool Only: TushuDiary is designed strictly as a personal finance management, khata tracker, and diary tool.','Not Certified Advice: The App does not provide certified financial, legal, investment, or tax advice. You are responsible for verifying your mathematical ledger records against official bank statements.']},{id:'termination',icon:o.ShieldAlert,title:'6. Account Termination & Enforcement',content:['Termination for Cause: We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts, revoke API access, or block compromised devices that violate these Terms or threaten service security.','Survival of Provisions: Sections regarding data ownership, disclaimers, and prohibited actions will survive any account termination.']}];return(0,l.jsxs)(t.SafeAreaView,{style:p.safeArea,children:[(0,l.jsx)(c.default,{}),(0,l.jsxs)(t.ScrollView,{contentContainerStyle:p.content,showsVerticalScrollIndicator:!1,children:[(0,l.jsxs)(t.View,{style:p.badgeCard,children:[(0,l.jsxs)(t.View,{style:p.badgeHeader,children:[(0,l.jsx)(o.FileText,{size:22,color:n.C.gold}),(0,l.jsx)(t.Text,{style:p.badgeTitle,children:"Terms of Service"})]}),(0,l.jsx)(t.Text,{style:p.badgeSubtitle,children:"Brand: CodeByTushu  \u2022  Effective: October 2026"}),(0,l.jsx)(t.Text,{style:p.badgeDescription,children:"Please read these terms carefully before using TushuDiary. They establish your rights, responsibilities, and data protections when using our service."})]}),s.map(e=>{var s=e.icon;return(0,l.jsxs)(t.View,{style: