hentication rules.','Offline / Guest Mode: Guest accounts store data strictly in local storage and never transmit records to remote cloud servers.']},{id:'device-permissions',icon:o.Smartphone,title:'4. Device Permissions & Usage',content:['Camera & Media Library: Requested strictly when you choose to take or attach receipts, profile avatars, or diary photos. We never access your camera or photos in the background.','Storage / File System: Used strictly when you trigger "Export to Excel/PDF" or "Backup / Restore" to save or select documents on your device.','Biometrics (Face ID / Fingerprint): Managed natively through your device\'s secure hardware (Secure Enclave / Android BiometricPrompt). Your biometric traits never leave your device or enter app memory.']},{id:'backups-exports',icon:o.FolderCheck,title:'5. Backups, Restores & Data Integrity',content:['User-Scoped Backups: Local backup archives contain only records matching your authenticated user ID.','Integrity & Anti-Tamper Verification: During database restoration, foreign account keys, unverified tokens, and extraneous data are strictly sanitized to prevent cross-account injection or corruption.','Encrypted Password Vault: Stored credentials in your vault are secured with client-side AES encryption.']},{id:'retention-deletion',icon:o.Trash2,title:'6. Data Retention & Deletion Rights',content:['Record Deletion: You can modify or permanently delete individual transactions, khata records, and diary notes at any time.','Recycle Bin: Soft-deleted items can be permanently purged or restored from the Recycle Bin.','Account & Cloud Purge: You have the right to request complete account and cloud record deletion via Settings > Contact Admin.','Local Data Wipe: Logging out clears session credentials; uninstalling the application or clearing device app data completely erases all local database records from your physical device.']},{id:'contact',icon:o.Mail,title:'7. Privacy Contact & Audits',content:['For privacy inquiries, audit questions, or data removal requests, reach out via Settings > Contact Admin or email privacy@codebytushu.com.']}];return(0,l.jsxs)(t.SafeAreaView,{style:y.safeArea,children:[(0,l.jsx)(c.default,{}),(0,l.jsxs)(t.ScrollView,{contentContainerStyle:y.content,showsVerticalScrollIndicator:!1,children:[(0,l.jsxs)(t.View,{style:y.badgeCard,children:[(0,l.jsxs)(t.View,{style:y.badgeHeader,children:[(0,l.jsx)(o.ShieldCheck,{size:22,color:n.C.gold}),(0,l.jsx)(t.Text,{style:y.badgeTitle,children:"TushuDiary Privacy Policy"})]}),(0,l.jsx)(t.Text,{style:y.badgeSubtitle,children:"Brand: CodeByTushu  \u2022  Version: 2.1 (October 2026)"}),(0,l.jsx)(t.Text,{style:y.badgeDescription,children:"We believe your financial and diary entries are strictly personal. This policy outlines our actual data architecture, isolation controls, and user privacy protections."})]}),s.map(e=>{var s=e.icon;return(0,l.jsxs)(t.View,{style:y.sectionCard,children:[(0,l.jsxs)(t.View,{style:y.sectionHeader,children:[(0,l.jsx)(t.View,{style:y.iconWrapper,children:(0,l.jsx)(s,{size:18,color:n.C.gold})}),(0,l.jsx)(t.Text,{style:y.sectionTitle,children:e.title})]}),(0,l.jsx)(t.View,{style:y.sectionBody,children:e.content.map((e,s)=>(0,l.jsxs)(t.View,{style:y.bulletRow,children:[(0,l.jsx)(o.CheckCircle2,{size:14,color:n.C.gold,style:y.bulletIcon}),(0,l.jsx)(t.Text,{style:y.bulletText,children:e})]},s))})]},e.id)}),(0,l.jsx)(t.View,{style:y.footer,children:(0,l.jsx)(t.Text,{style:y.footerText,children:"TushuDiary  \u2022  CodeByTushu  \u2022  Your Life, Your Diary."})})]})]})}var y=t.StyleSheet.create({safeArea:{flex:1,backgroundColor:n.C.bg||'#050505'},content:{padding:16,paddingBottom:40},badgeCard:{backgroundColor:'rgba(240, 165, 0, 0.08)',borderColor:n.C.goldBorder||'rgba(240, 165, 0, 0.35)',borderWidth:1,borderRadius:14,padding:16,marginBottom:20},badgeHeader:{flexDirection:'row',alignItems:'center',gap:10,marginBottom:6},badgeTitle:{fontSize:17,fontWeight:'700',color:n.C.gold||'#F0A500',letterSpacin